  "vv11:0.4": "93. 11. Paṭhamapatibbatāvimānavatthu ",
  "vv11:1.1": "‘‘Koñcā mayūrā diviyā ca haṃsā, ",
  "vv11:1.2": "vaggussarā kokilā sampatanti; ",
  "vv11:1.3": "Pupphābhikiṇṇaṃ rammamidaṃ vimānaṃ, ",
  "vv11:1.4": "anekacittaṃ naranārisevitaṃ . ",
  "vv11:2.1": "94. ‘‘Tatthacchasi devi mahānubhāve, ",
  "vv11:2.2": "iddhī vikubbanti anekarūpā; ",
  "vv11:2.3": "Imā ca te accharāyo samantato, ",
  "vv11:2.4": "naccanti gāyanti pamodayanti ca. ",
  "vv11:3.1": "95. ‘‘Deviddhipattāsi mahānubhāve, ",
  "vv11:3.2": "manussabhūtā kimakāsi puññaṃ; ",
  "vv11:3.3": "Kenāsi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā, ",
  "vv11:3.4": "vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv11:4.1": "96. Sā devatā attamanā, ",
  "vv11:4.2": "moggallānena pucchitā; ",
  "vv11:4.3": "Pañhaṃ puṭṭhā viyākāsi, ",
  "vv11:4.4": "yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ. ",
  "vv11:5.1": "97. ‘‘Ahaṃ manussesu manussabhūtā, ",
  "vv11:5.2": "patibbatānaññamanā ahosiṃ; ",
  "vv11:5.3": "Mātāva puttaṃ anurakkhamānā, ",
  "vv11:5.4": "kuddhāpihaṃ nappharusaṃ avocaṃ. ",
  "vv11:6.1": "98. ‘‘Sacce ṭhitā mosavajjaṃ pahāya, ",
  "vv11:6.2": "dāne ratā saṅgahitattabhāvā; ",
  "vv11:6.3": "Annañca pānañca pasannacittā, ",
  "vv11:6.4": "sakkacca dānaṃ vipulaṃ adāsiṃ. ",
  "vv11:7.1": "99. ‘‘Tena metādiso vaṇṇo, ",
  "vv11:7.2": "tena me idha mijjhati; ",
  "vv11:7.3": "Uppajjanti ca me bhogā, ",
  "vv11:7.4": "ye keci manaso piyā. ",
  "vv11:8.1": "100. ‘‘Akkhāmi te bhikkhu mahānubhāva, ",
  "vv11:8.2": "manussabhūtā yamakāsi puññaṃ; ",
  "vv11:8.3": "Tenamhi evaṃ jalitānubhāvā, ",
  "vv11:8.4": "vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī’’ti. ",
  "vv11:9.1": "Paṭhamapatibbatāvimānaṃ ekādasamaṃ. "
}
